0405.v1"},{"name":"AWS Terrain Tiles (Terrarium), from SRTM, GMTED2010, ETOPO1 and national elevation models","url":"https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/"},{"name":"Wikipedia, Lapse rate (6.5 °C cooler per 1,000 m, the standard atmosphere)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lapse_rate"},{"name":"Macrostrat geologic map, the most detailed map unit at each point (CC BY 4.0)","url":"https://macrostrat.org/api/v2/geologic_units/map"},{"name":"Wikipedia, List of vineyard soil types (revision of 26 November 2025, after Stevenson, Sotheby's Wine Encyclopedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_vineyard_soil_types&oldid=1324185522"},{"name":"SommSelect, A Quick and Dirty Guide to Wine Soils","url":"https://sommselect.com/blogs/tasting-notes/a-quick-dirty-guide-to-wine-soils"},{"name":"WSET Level 4 Diploma in Wines, Specification, Issue 1 (2019), the principal regions of Units D3, D4 and D5","url":"https://www.wsetglobal.com/media/7084/wset_l4wines_specification_en_may2019.pdf"}]}